    {"requirement_id": "inspected_pipeline_pilot", "status": "PARTIAL_B4_COMPLETE_B2_HOST_EXECUTION_PENDING", "evidence": "60 B4 outputs accepted on inspected physical episodes; zero valid B2 outputs; three retained technical failures; 57 B2 requests never launched. The CLI, Codex LB credential, and ChatGPT login are present. The managed shell exports CODEX_SANDBOX_NETWORK_DISABLED=1, so its lookup failures are a parent socket restriction rather than a DNS/authentication defect. Model work must resume from a normal network-enabled host with the same repository and immutable caches, only after READY_FOR_SCHEMA_CANARY."},
