    {"requirement_id": "two_agent_annotation_dry_run", "status": "TOOLING_READY_HOST_RUN_NOT_RUN", "evidence": "Completed-return validation requires exact claim/unit/limitation coverage, spans, distinct agent identities, and blinded attestation. The no-tool structured runner is implemented and unit-tested; empirical calls must run from a normal network-enabled host after READY_FOR_SCHEMA_CANARY."},
